    "_about":  "Recorded from a second test site on 2026-11-24: ticket OD-2 and the three runbooks in its IT Knowledge Base space (IKB, type collaboration), page bodies in Confluence storage format. The description is plain text, as the Jira adapter produces it from ADF (the wiki markup {{...}} monospace wrapper removed).",
    "ticket":  {
