                   "summary":  "Login service is experiencing intermittent failures",
                   "description":  "Users across multiple regions are reporting inability to log in. The auth service is returning 503 errors. First reported at 09:00 UTC. Affecting approximately 30% of login attempts. Auth team is investigating. Service: `auth-service`."
